    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9d99fa4b121d56fcab14b48e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在粉丝感谢祭上，莱茵力量因东商变革\n那能够推翻常识的活跃身姿而深受感动。",
      "source_fingerprint": "613368bda02cfee16182293721daeaef7d7322f90509d335a9b02951b62b94ea",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
