    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:60482c121ed46bd92c3649da",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "莱茵力量传达了“想变得像你一样”\n的憧憬之情。但是，却被指出\n那样的话就只是在模仿别人而已。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e1665f789ed25a4439fd7a862cf3414e81ecd0c3b7ca9d0b4db18784a187c21c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1109/storytimeline_501109404.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9e8bf00a14d2a527828cc260",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1109/storytimeline_501109404.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5f3842be2e2c94508697997c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "之后，她重新回顾了\n后冠赛马娘们的活跃表现，\n意识到了重要的一点。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7d8d793b0b465b712ef22bf7b08c27f1837db0af5dc72bdf2ece07a1dc2e0df2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1109/storytimeline_501109404.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a6abc4f1fc7f78d0ee3aa960",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1109/storytimeline_501109404.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:14ff3a74879ee7083900fdec",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她所憧憬的是，为追求属于自己的光辉\n而奔驰的后冠赛马娘们的背影。\n她希望自己也能成为别人憧憬的对象。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b9ab2ce4a6be38bce26486cac988b407e5da578d777ef9b3343e468dc1a7738e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1109/storytimeline_501109404.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b104373c6093119a16c0d3ef",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1109/storytimeline_501109404.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        4,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/4/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0c0d49b8d355a9271e44e170",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "为开拓前人未踏之路，绽放属于自己的光辉。\n莱茵力量把制霸『樱花赏』和\n『NHK英里杯』作为了自己的目标。",
      "source_fingerprint": "66477549d9e45bee3ae9fe74f1566c9e2b51f7edba6ab0013e7f4d0af134afe3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1109/storytimeline_501109404.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        4,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/4/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0cec21c4084be417816e5241",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "后冠赛马娘",
      "source_fingerprint": "b03ab8fca0f80c2a40db35c545631c22bcb0b8742f004ee80a81785286b7126f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1109/storytimeline_501109404.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:19cbe269923d6f22358c7c38",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "莱茵力量热切希望去观看\n东商变革的『宝冢纪念』。\n得到许可后的她非常开心。",
      "source_fingerprint": "da582975c65d41d197f5206e20e9fd44eed3a157be853bb2fa54502729a81e01",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1109/storytimeline_501109405.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f1d6f0678f61e7641a17a237",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "战胜三冠路线的马娘们，颠覆无聊的常识。\n她很期待看到这种魔法般的赛跑。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e2b5c6f37657946f25e1c84005c0a4ac5bb3869c06b023795e4d2b50603e8a9d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1109/storytimeline_501109405.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f54fff479710fdc2bd55c279",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "当天晚上，她邀请西沙里奥去\n观看『宝冢纪念』，但遭到拒绝。\n因为西沙里奥将挑战美国的GⅠ赛事。",
      "source_fingerprint": "031f3f8a0420470fbee6a474c3fa25dcd5d91f1b27243a839c5ca528f8a966e7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1109/storytimeline_501109405.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aa19b26b01bf96b5cfbed723",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "西沙里奥说，自己对刻下了后冠新历史的\n莱茵力量充满了憧憬。正因如此，\n才想要去超越这个背影。",
      "source_fingerprint": "dd058988faa665efd750272d6a0c0eb0c79c8074912ef0c348cf6c3460b36388",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1109/storytimeline_501109405.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9bdf8087964db2a1f0e700b8",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "莱茵力量相信，如果是西沙里奥的话，\n一定能开创后冠的新未来。\n并送上了发自内心的声援。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fa80f68fec6476583ffed298ecc14115c22cc628432433f628129df9d421c227",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1109/storytimeline_501109405.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        4,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/4/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6bc31df3ac006eb9cd0f3607",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "奔向各自的道路",
      "source_fingerprint": "a23d3995adcb63d02afde2c775eadfbdc53483d8a5b9a50cd5511e818f3124fd",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1109/storytimeline_501109405.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5f59ebd86108b98744ad4e2c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "莱茵力量来到了『宝冢纪念』现场观战。\n在这里，她看到了东商变革获胜的瞬间。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ab249e0cc2391bc7a9abe32733bbe4ab9d81df0580361199b401f57a1c3caa2d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1109/storytimeline_501109406.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f2c6486e6ae5e6a166e82c8a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "后冠赛马娘打败了三冠路线的豪强们。\n面对如此颠覆常识的伟业，\n她感受到了后冠赛马娘新的可能性。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ef9105f1a5ed1981eb74df99fd51c045bf87e5977f63253593101a9276f4979d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1109/storytimeline_501109406.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cfd28698ece8bd95de111e93",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "接着，参加美国GⅠ赛事的西沙里奥\n也获得了胜利。面对日本赛马史上\n首次的功绩，莱茵力量兴奋不已。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e42beba6b99d59bba73e7c12767df5c6f8ce411817a4428e42837ee1a0d7fd04",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1109/storytimeline_501109406.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7947477f10df1fb74e045d12",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在我们的手中，\n后冠赛马娘的未来正在扩大。\n莱茵力量如此强烈地感受到了这一点。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1e18e8e2cc1fa0ca3462828ca4f23faaccf386666c9ab014fe639ea4b51799de",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1109/storytimeline_501109406.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e233a87a9bf22a0b25b4eb80",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "——另一方面，面对活跃在赛场上\n留下了历史足迹的同期们，\n空中救主产生了焦虑……",
      "source_fingerprint": "3501092f8708991e0c204dc42e87bed3fb9b628c92ea11a2573998b7c9e5b565",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1109/storytimeline_501109406.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        4,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/4/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:41287d126d370d6c726d2683",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "后冠的可能性",
      "source_fingerprint": "2066597e4721f4c9d6d8d5acd2f549438e68069e47b2dc82b96a073befd0984c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1109/storytimeline_501109406.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e57aa23437492bda8ef3119b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1109/storytimeline_501109407.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:300da72bf0028e1423084965",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "莱茵力量还是没有醒来……\n但是，训练员不会放弃。\n而她则应该要用自己的双手去抓住奇迹。",
      "source_fingerprint": "09e575bf2c896984659f5dc3c36553d0202076e5b73b2e01300a5b2ebb94311d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1109/storytimeline_501109407.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:755b99c62c3ab44ca4ad8298",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1109/storytimeline_501109407.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ee780663ee56cbcc60a127e8",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "训练员找到后冠赛马娘们，\n一起赶来了莱茵力量的病房。\n大家拼命的呼喊着“再来一起比赛吧”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "917ef266fd5a623ddaf1c58a559e091766d5dc8e03f060b681a8733310bcc1b0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1109/storytimeline_501109407.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ede9378eff96d9bf0f8bfdd8",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1109/storytimeline_501109407.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4fba7568eaf3594f66b188cf",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "另一方面，莱茵力量与梦中和自己\n姿态相同的『我』对峙着。\n『我』这么说道……什么都没能留下。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8cda4df2f0e2a7d173c07b043832fea00e1c452b9a6b62f02e8bda1e8a81ee4c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
