    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f6875d40fa080d0b19725485",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "今天开始要进行夏季集训。\n面对即将到来的『秋华赏』，\n莱茵力量斗志昂扬。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ca6ae3775bf9135b2fa16be5aa67cb65d824b1300ce0b5c38327b791bb1f61f7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
