      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "不过，她应该不会不参加三后冠的最终战。\n像这样转换心情后，\n莱茵力量参加了夏季集训。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0f1dd2ff661cf96234d45731c47c41af23206c4cd240f74cc8b24aea2308cf33",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1109/storytimeline_501109408.json",
