    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bb7a5dafe0272a4657d35037",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "莱茵力量又像往常那样做了梦。\n她梦到空中救主和勇敢之心指导着\n小的马娘们。",
      "source_fingerprint": "55d92295139c27ff2b6089099b7bf9d03c50500abcfbca307b6fa564a7fd9da3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
