    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3f19665fd9a11d154f2c45ed",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "莱茵力量醒来后，\n训练员带她去医院做了检查。\n但是检查结果没有异常。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2b399809ea6a583715e6a2152111fa83bb348bd4ab413d65b1720bce9d6648c6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
