    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:322084c44d3c04f95d685956",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "睡觉的时候做了一个好梦，\n所以没问题的——莱茵力量这么说着，\n展现出了对夏季集训的热切意愿。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b9d30eb573d8ae39871d76871496c37f7be46c285f50f8af638db56e6769da1d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
