    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0a4bb87afd76f8521a86bb12",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "莱茵力量从训练员那里得到了\n关于出道战的提议。\n说是“京都赛场草地1400米怎么样？”",
      "source_fingerprint": "b06862914aefacd61d690a76913859ea928b9a435184986f9724c8adf29ca781",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1109/storytimeline_501109410.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:66213dc183a6b5a2dcfc5000",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1109/storytimeline_501109410.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a9b3b342b22ed42407ba9a59",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她对这个提议大为喜欢！\n因为这和自己憧憬的赛马娘・东商变革\n的出道战是一样的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d5a3e50bd2af86d013286e4efd60b12e548494946ad5c484792e8d139b10e654",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1109/storytimeline_501109410.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
