      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8ed3dd96523b3a40ada6d3e9",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "像带着魔法一样奔跑的东商变革。\n自己也想像她一样让大家心动不已！",
